Improved power output increases the speed of your projectiles by [42%, 62%, 75%, 84%, 91% (TL1-5)], critical damage by [10%, 18%, 24%, 30%, 35% (TL1-5)], and allows you to automatically reload each turn.

In addition, you can instantly activate this talent to gain a sudden burst of speed, moving to a tile in range [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)].
